of sorted items from a vector to a label vector and the R function 'order' does this.
I tried to use nimbleRcall to get this working but it gives an error

This is the code I used:

order <- nimbleRcall(function(x = double(1)){}, Rfun = 'order',
                    returnType = integer(1))

and the nimble program code is

CST<-nimbleCode({
for (i in 1:m){
for (j in 1:J){
y0[i,j]~dpois(expe[i,j]*lam0[i,j])
log(lam0[i,j])<-a0+b0[1]*x1[i]+b0[2]*x2[i]
}}
for(i in 1:m){
for(j in 1:J){
for(l in 1:m){
