To give a quick reply, have you tried using a different name for "order"?  Unfortunately, sometimes nimble doesn't always find things as you would hope based on R's scoping, and it may be finding R's order instead of the order you created.  Giving a unique name might help.  Also I think you will need C[1:m]<-order(as[1:m]), that is with indices for as.

-Perry

